  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "There’s only one Pokémon with a body made of\nplasma that lets it infiltrate appliances...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re talking about Rotom, of course!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065201900720065002000740061006C006B0069006E0067002000610062006F0075007400200052006F0074006F006D002C0020006F006600200063006F0075007200730065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see you have a Rotom Phone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000730065006500200079006F0075002000680061007600650020006100200052006F0074006F006D002000500068006F006E0065002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rotom Phones are very valuable! After all, there\ncan’t be an infinite supply of them. There aren’t<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nenough Rotom in the world for that!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rotom Phones are amazing, yes, but Rotom truly\nshines when it enters a household appliance!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Want to battle different forms of Rotom as it\npossesses various appliances?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If so, just let me know!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200073006F002C0020006A0075007300740020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder what appliances Rotom will take over!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200077006F006E006400650072002000770068006100740020006100700070006C00690061006E00630065007300200052006F0074006F006D002000770069006C006C002000740061006B00650020006F007600650072002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to battle against Rotom’s different\nforms?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200072006500610064007900200074006F00200062006100740074006C006500200061006700610069006E0073007400200052006F0074006F006D2019007300200064006900660066006500720065006E0074000A0066006F0072006D0073003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200079006500740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t leave us in suspense! Please, battle Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E201900740020006C006500610076006500200075007300200069006E002000730075007300700065006E00730065002100200050006C0065006100730065002C00200062006100740074006C006500200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Presenting the amazing, awe-inspiring Rotom!\nWatch as it inspirits all sorts of appliances!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIntroducing our first Rotom...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder what appliances Rotom will take over!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200077006F006E006400650072002000770068006100740020006100700070006C00690061006E00630065007300200052006F0074006F006D002000770069006C006C002000740061006B00650020006F007600650072002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heat Rotom! That’s the name for a Rotom when it\npossesses a microwave oven like this!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heat Rotom is an Electric- and Fire-type Pokémon!\nAnd look—it’s no longer a Ghost type!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this form, it can learn the move Overheat!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020007400680069007300200066006F0072006D002C002000690074002000630061006E0020006C006500610072006E00200074006800650020006D006F007600650020004F0076006500720068006500610074002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If Heat Rotom’s happy, your food will come out\ncrisp and juicy. If not...I hope you like it burnt!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this Pokémon battle, I’ll be showing you the\nbest Rotom has to offer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Could you feel the HEAT from Heat Rotom?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006600650065006C002000740068006500200048004500410054002000660072006F006D0020004800650061007400200052006F0074006F006D003F002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Next—Wash Rotom! That’s what we call a Rotom\nthat possesses a washing machine!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m awash with excitement!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D002000610077006100730068002000770069007400680020006500780063006900740065006D0065006E0074002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wash Rotom is an Electric- and Water-type\nPokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700610073006800200052006F0074006F006D00200069007300200061006E00200045006C006500630074007200690063002D00200061006E0064002000570061007400650072002D0074007900700065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this form, it can learn the move Hydro Pump!\nJust thinking about it PUMPS me up!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s very considerate—it’ll only start washing a\nload of laundry if you’ve added detergent to it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But there’s always the risk of it flooding your\nhome!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020007400680065007200652019007300200061006C007700610079007300200074006800650020007200690073006B0020006F006600200069007400200066006C006F006F00640069006E006700200079006F00750072000A0068006F006D0065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet Wash Rotom washed away any doubts you\nhad about it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200062006500740020005700610073006800200052006F0074006F006D00200077006100730068006500640020006100770061007900200061006E007900200064006F007500620074007300200079006F0075000A006800610064002000610062006F00750074002000690074002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Coming up, we’ve got a Rotom that has seized\ncontrol of a lawn mower...Mow Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is the mow-ment we’ve all been waiting for!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200069007300200074006800650020006D006F0077002D006D0065006E007400200077006520190076006500200061006C006C0020006200650065006E002000770061006900740069006E006700200066006F0072002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mow Rotom is an Electric- and Grass-type\nPokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007700200052006F0074006F006D00200069007300200061006E00200045006C006500630074007200690063002D00200061006E0064002000470072006100730073002D0074007900700065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this form, it can learn the move Leaf Storm!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020007400680069007300200066006F0072006D002C002000690074002000630061006E0020006C006500610072006E00200074006800650020006D006F007600650020004C006500610066002000530074006F0072006D002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The only question is whether you have a lawn big\nenough for it to mow.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It swaggers around as it scatters grass clippings\neverywhere... What a mischief-maker!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mow Rotom’s mowing power is mow-st\nimpressive, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007700200052006F0074006F006D201900730020006D006F00770069006E006700200070006F0077006500720020006900730020006D006F0077002D00730074000A0069006D00700072006500730073006900760065002C0020006800750068003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Next in line is Fan Rotom! That’s the name for a\nRotom that has taken over a fan!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How fan-tastic!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000660061006E002D007400610073007400690063002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fan Rotom is an Electric- and Flying-type\nPokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460061006E00200052006F0074006F006D00200069007300200061006E00200045006C006500630074007200690063002D00200061006E006400200046006C00790069006E0067002D0074007900700065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this form, it can learn the move Air Slash!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020007400680069007300200066006F0072006D002C002000690074002000630061006E0020006C006500610072006E00200074006800650020006D006F00760065002000410069007200200053006C006100730068002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And since Rotom understands voice commands,\nordering it to use that move is a breeze!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But it’s also quite the prankster... You never know\nwhen it’ll blow your important documents away!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure Fan Rotom absolutely blew you away too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200073007500720065002000460061006E00200052006F0074006F006D0020006100620073006F006C007500740065006C007900200062006C0065007700200079006F00750020006100770061007900200074006F006F002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And last but not least, Frost Rotom! That’s what\nRotom is called when it takes over a refrigerator.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s so cool, it gives me the chills!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100742019007300200073006F00200063006F006F006C002C0020006900740020006700690076006500730020006D006500200074006800650020006300680069006C006C0073002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Frost Rotom is an Electric- and Ice-type Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460072006F0073007400200052006F0074006F006D00200069007300200061006E00200045006C006500630074007200690063002D00200061006E00640020004900630065002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In this form, it can learn the move Blizzard!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020007400680069007300200066006F0072006D002C002000690074002000630061006E0020006C006500610072006E00200074006800650020006D006F0076006500200042006C0069007A007A006100720064002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It wreaks havoc by freezing everything around it!\nThat doesn’t really sell you on it, huh...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "By the way, I hear Rotom’s form changes have\nsomething to do with its special motor!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was such a motormouth talking up Rotom that I\nhardly noticed the battle had ended!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In the Galar region, you can find Rotom hard at\nwork as Drone Rotom and Rotom Bikes too.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But remember: Rotom is a prankster to the core!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000720065006D0065006D006200650072003A00200052006F0074006F006D002000690073002000610020007000720061006E006B007300740065007200200074006F002000740068006500200063006F00720065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rotom’s antics while it’s inhabiting an appliance\ncan be difficult to keep under control.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Trainer like you would probably have no trouble\nmastering all its forms in battle, though!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s why we’re happy to present you with a\ncatalog you can use to change Rotom’s form!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 7952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Try using that catalog if you ever catch a wild\nRotom somewhere.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200790020007500730069006E00670020007400680061007400200063006100740061006C006F006700200069006600200079006F00750020006500760065007200200063006100740063006800200061002000770069006C0064000A0052006F0074006F006D00200073006F006D006500770068006500720065002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure Rotom will take on even more forms as\nnew devices and appliances are invented.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In other words, Rotom’s possibilities are endless!\nInfinite Rotom... What an inspiriting idea!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you been using the Rotom Catalog to\nchange Rotom’s form?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610076006500200079006F00750020006200650065006E0020007500730069006E0067002000740068006500200052006F0074006F006D00200043006100740061006C006F006700200074006F000A006300680061006E0067006500200052006F0074006F006D2019007300200066006F0072006D003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You never know... One of these days you might\nfind Rotom wreaking havoc with your appliances!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bzzz-zzzrt!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 9004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007A007A007A002D007A007A007A0072007400210000",
